  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Peel, core, and slice the nectarines into a 9-inch baking dish.",
    "In a separate bowl, combine the gluten-free oats, brown sugar, almond flour, and salt.",
    "Add the cold unsalted butter to the dry ingredients and mix until crumbly.",
    "Spread the crumble mixture evenly over the nectarines.",
    "Bake for 35-40 minutes or until the topping is golden brown and the fruit is tender.",
    "Serve warm with a scoop of vanilla ice cream, if desired."
